Third-party provenance and notices
==================================

This repository is a patch-based integration workflow. It does not distribute
a complete Google kernel source tree, factory image, or KernelSU-Next source
tree. Obtain those inputs from their respective upstream sources.

Google kernel base
------------------

The patch series targets the Google redbull Android 14 / Linux 4.19 kernel
base pinned in config/versions.env. Its source is obtained through the Android
kernel manifest documented in guide.md. Google and Linux kernel copyright and
license notices remain applicable to that source tree and to any resulting
derivative kernel image.

KernelSU-Next
-------------

ksun-disable-seccomp-filter-count.patch is applied to the KernelSU-Next
revision pinned in config/versions.env. KernelSU-Next is obtained separately
from https://github.com/sidex15/KernelSU-Next . Preserve the upstream notices
and license when redistributing any KernelSU-Next-derived material.

SuSFS v2.2.0 reference port
----------------------------

patches/susfs-v2.2.0-redbull.patch adapts material from
https://github.com/sreeshankark/android_kernel_oneplus_avicii , branch 14,
commit 3f46c998. The patch is adapted for the pinned Pixel 5 Google base; it
does not replace the upstream copyright or licensing terms.

